WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Choose the operating model
Store sells your own stock. Marketplace adds approved sellers. Published
versions carry the actual package terms; the preview prices are test
examples.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Enter business and contact details
Give the owner’s reachable phone number. Save it for the application
status check.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Choose mode and package
Select Store or Marketplace. Choose a published package or ask for
assistance.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Review before submitting
Check the name, phone, operating mode and package. Back keeps your
entered details.

5
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Keep your private reference
Submission produces a private reference. Approval and owner handover are
separate steps.

6
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Follow the review
Use the reference and application phone to see the current review state.

7
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Review the package and retain a reason
An authorized admin reviews business details, selects an eligible
version and records notes before approval or rejection. This capture
shows review only; it does not approve the demo merchant.
